omer with customised affilate code - plus 15% comission paid directly to you</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">&bull; Payment terms:</span></p>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Commission structure</span></div>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">15.00% commission</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Exclude taxes and shipping</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Paid monthly&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">payment via bank transfer or paypal&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"></p>",
